- [ ] Push cannot satisfy the row.
- [ ] Unicode/CRLF diagnostic, completion, navigation and edit-currentness are directly host-observed.
- [ ] Restart/reopen preserves exact installed subject and produces current state.
- [ ] #11361 emits only cells directly re-exercised at this stage.
- [ ] Released/source, local/public, Linux/other platforms and unrun cells remain distinct.
- [ ] Cleanup removes all test-owned host/server/result/package/install state.

