## Strict read-only boundary

This Review is **strictly READ-ONLY**.

Do **not**:

- delete;
- move;
- rename;
- modify;
- touch/update file contents;
- prune;
- archive;
- reset;
- restore;
- checkout/switch branches;
- commit;
